        "resolved_dependencies": "uv.lock resolved 2026-10-05 with exclude-newer and no prereleases: qdrant-client 1.19.1, openai 3.24.0, spacy 3.8.16, fastembed 0.8.1, posthog 7.62.1. pip install mem0ai resolves the same way; mem0's poetry.lock is not used by its hatch build."
